      ["section", "2.3"]
    ],
    "comment": "Both scopes are derived by covert movement of the two ⟨eit,it⟩ phrases, triggered by the optional i features on little v and ordered by Scope Economy; (21) gives the inverse and (23) the surface truth conditions.",
